{title: Dank sei dir}
{subtitle: We Give Thanks to Thee}
{song_number: 69}
{key: D}
{tempo: 92}
{language: de}

[D]Dank sei dir, ja, Dank [F#m]sei dir, wir [G]dan[A]ken
[D]dir, [G]Herr. [D]
